data: {"id": "b9613e9fbf6a493c-thinking-parallel_evidence-1681", "run_id": "b9613e9fbf6a493c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n| **Pod 状态** | `phase=Running`，但容器 `app` 状态为 `Waiting: CrashLoopBackOff`，`Ready=False`，`restarts=5` |\n| **Exit Code** | `127`（命令未找到），`Last State Reason=Error`，非 OOMKilled |\n| **Command** | `sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command` — 启动命令指向镜像中不存在的可执行文件 |\n| **Previous Logs** | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found`（重复出现 5 次，与重启次数一致） |\n| **Events** | 仅 `Back-off restarting failed container app`，无 OOMKilled、ProbeFailed、Killing 事件 |\n| **重启趋势*", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789132034026, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

